• A rustic/restic snapshot ID is the SHA-256 hash of the snapshot metadata object—not a sequence number or the hash of all backed-up files.

  That metadata includes information such as:

  - Creation time
  - Hostname
  - Backed-up paths
  - Tags
  - The root tree ID pointing to the snapshot’s files

restic restore snapshot id
